  "id": "list_dem_25m",
  "title": "LIST DEM 25 m",
  "description": "LIST DEM 25 m: LIST product `LIST_DEM_25M`, statewide. Float32 grid, 25 x 25 cells, EPSG:28355. Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per feature id, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2021-01-13. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST DEM 25 m\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
